COMMERCIAL S3.2 SERVER TEST WORKDIR DIAGNOSIS — 2026-08-29

Observed safe failure
---------------------
The first code-only server delta successfully bound Application commit
9f82e3c682a0f59a4675cca568058a3779a4a4ed and Control commit
a27dcedaf0653a7b34a78f4a8a742f6dddd9ed26. The immediately following focused
Application unittest command exited before the probe with
`ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'tests'`.

Proven cause
------------
The remote orchestration invoked named unittest modules while its current
directory was not `/opt/tu1nz_repos/adult-publishing-core`. `PYTHONPATH` bound
the Application source package but did not make the repository's `tests`
package importable from the unrelated working directory.

